{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01831","headline":"杂曲歌辞 生别离 · 孟云卿","name":"杂曲歌辞 生别离","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"结发生别离，相思复相保。\n何知日已久，五变庭中草。\n眇眇天海途，悠悠吴江岛。\n但恐不出门，出门无远道。\n远道行既难，家贫衣服单。\n严风吹积雪，晨起鼻何酸。\n人生各有恋，岂不怀所安。\n分明天上日，生死誓同欢。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟云卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01831.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01831","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}